    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=bterrirxvg]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=bterrirxvg]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=nridvrj2au]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=nridvrj2au]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=mz3hdx93se]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=mz3hdx93se]{color:#cccccc}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"IntegrationPoints-AboutIntegrationPoints\">About Integration Points&nbsp;</h2><p><span>When getting the data for appointments, if users would want to display additional information per appointment from other modules in Bahmni.</span></p><p><span>This can be made possible by extending the interface ''</span><span>AppointmentResponseExtension'' and implementing the run method which takes appointment as input and returns a map of attributes. </span><span>The returned map values are added to the appointments additional information</span></p><h2 id=\"IntegrationPoints-Howtosetup\">How to set up&nbsp;</h2><p>This extension code should be added in the implementation specific omods.</p><p><span style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\">1.&nbsp;Add appointments module as required module in the </span><span>&nbsp;omod/src/main/resources/config.xml</span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"65d7fa6f-adcc-4d4a-8520-5c86dedd6b9d\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: xml; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&lt;require_module&gt;org.openmrs.module.appointments&lt;/require_module&gt;</pre>\n</div></div><p>2. Add appointments module dependency in the pom.xml</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"bed290a0-d064-4aae-9dea-fcf70de29e98\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: xml; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&lt;dependency&gt;\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;groupId&gt;org.openmrs.module&lt;/groupId&gt;\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;artifactId&gt;appointments-omod&lt;/artifactId&gt;\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;version&gt;1.0-SNAPSHOT&lt;/version&gt;\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;scope&gt;provided&lt;/scope&gt;\n&lt;/dependency&gt;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span>3. Implement extension point</span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"507be31e-237b-411c-9f8c-33fef748e330\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">@Component\npublic class PatientBedDetails implements AppointmentResponseExtension {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;@Override\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;public Map&lt;String, String&gt; run(Appointment appointment) {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Map&lt;String, String&gt; additionalInfo = new HashMap&lt;&gt;();\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BedManagementService bedManagementService = Context.getService(BedManagementService.class);\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BedDetails bedDetails = bedManagementService.getBedAssignmentDetailsByPatient(appointment.getPatient());\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if(bedDetails!= null) {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;additionalInfo.put(&quot;LOCATION_KEY&quot;, bedDetails.getPhysicalLocation().getName());\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;additionalInfo.put(&quot;BED_NUMBER_KEY&quot;, bedDetails.getBedNumber());\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return additionalInfo;\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}\n}</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"37e336dd-c97b-4c9b-b0e2-bec9631e1bfa\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Note</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ol><li><span data-colorid=\"bterrirxvg\">In the code above , you can use any service to fetch the relevant data from the database</span></li><li><span data-colorid=\"mz3hdx93se\"><span data-colorid=\"nridvrj2au\">As an Example we taken bedDetails. You can use relevant model, as per the use case, to get the data.</span></span></li></ol></div></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3ddaab34-1f85-4e7d-9246-8c3d0b6d7639\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>On This Page</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"f68c96e2-e787-4bfc-8876-768476c34b9d\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
